  "prefLabel": "Tax 102.23 Exemption appeal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tax 102.23 “Exemption appeal” means an RSA 72:34-a appeal from a municipality's refusal to grant an applicant an exemption, credit, or deferral under RSA 72.\n\nSource. #7152, eff 12-10-99 (formerly Tax 101.20); ss by 8985, eff 9-24-07 (from Tax 102.23); ss by #10623, eff 6-26-14 (from Tax 102.25); ss by 13686, eff 7-19-23",
